              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Solomoni bwe yamala okusaba kwe, omuliro gwaghanuka okuva mu igulu, gwayokya ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa n'emisengo gwabisaanaigho. N'okumesunkana okw'ekitiisa kya Musengwa Katonda kwabuna eisinzizo eryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabona tibaasobola kwingira mu isinzizo, kuba okumesunkana okw'ekitiisa kya Musengwa Katonda kwali kulibunie lyonalyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
